pre-change loops verbatim (in-test reference forms): y spans `range(min(y0,y1),
max(y0,y1)+1)` / `range(y0+1, ybus)`, bus row `range(xa+1, xb)`.

    $ python -B -m pytest -q -s -p no:cacheprovider tests/test_perf_paint_clip.py::test_wire_count_budget
    wire calls for l,j on wide-2000 at 118x34 (counter reset after mount): 23983998 (baseline 23983998, cap 61500)
